  "method": "Each sample is a separate process, 1s per case, GOMAXPROCS=2, with no concurrent builds or tests. Before/after order alternates, with three process samples per revision and case. Both protocol fixtures use the same fixed test PSK so Snell v6 shaping profiles match. Earlier exploratory random-PSK protocol samples are excluded.",
