  "scope": "Steady microbenchmarks reuse owned input storage and exclude ingress/socket/protocol costs as documented. Protocol loopbacks include real TCP and both protocol endpoints plus adapter/deadline/ref/traffic wrappers, but bypass tunnel routing/sender queues. No WAN, RSS/retained-heap, CI, or non-macOS socket measurements.",
